  v.innerHTML=`<section class="staffIntro card"><div><span class="staffKicker">THE TEAM BEHIND THE WALLS</span><h3>Meet the people behind Outpost X.</h3><p>The people keeping Outpost X running, helping players, and occasionally containing or causing the chaos.</p></div><article class="watcherStaffCard"><div class="watcherScan"></div><img src="/portal/assets/staff/watcher-staff.webp" alt="The Watcher"><div class="watcherStaffCopy"><span class="status good">SYSTEM ONLINE</span><small>CUSTOM BOT · SERVER INTELLIGENCE</small><h3>The Watcher</h3><p>Automation, player services, monitoring, events, surveillance, and questionable decision support.</p></div></article></section><section class="staffGrid">${staff.map(s=>`<article class="staffCard ${s.owner?'ownerCard':''} ${s.magic?'magicCard':''}"><div class="staffPortrait"><img src="/portal/assets/staff/${s.image}.webp" alt="${esc(s.name)}"><div class="staffGlow"></div><span class="staffRole ${s.owner?'ownerRole':''}">${esc(s.role)}</span></div><div class="staffBody"><small>${esc(s.tag)}</small><h3>${esc(s.name)}</h3><p>${esc(s.quote)}</p></div></article>`).join('')}</section><section class="staffHelp card"><div><span class="staffKicker">NEED STAFF HELP?</span><h3>Use the ticket system so the right person can help.</h3><p>For account problems, vehicle issues, rule questions, shop approval, reports, or technical support, open a ticket through Discord instead of privately messaging staff.</p></div><a class="btn primary" href="https://discord.com/channels/1516269432538661025/1531709557997306027" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Discord</a></section>`;
